      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This book is dedicated to those who do not escape their thoughts… "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 72
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "but keep returning to them, trying to understand why they never fully end. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 73
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "To those who have mistaken repetition for attachment… "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 74
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "and silence for loss. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 75
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And to those who are slowly realizing that the most complex thing they will ever "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 76
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "face… "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 77
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "is not the world outside… "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 78
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "but the patterns inside their own mind. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 79
    }
  ],
